{
  "name": "Day 44 Solution: AI Agent Communication",
  "description": "Agent-to-agent communication hub: validates a message envelope, routes it by message_type, drafts real OpenAI replies for requests, sends real Telegram/Slack messages for responses/broadcasts, then logs the exchange for real to Airtable.",
  "tags": [
    "week-07",
    "ai-agents",
    "day-44",
    "communication",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 44 Solution: AI Agent Communication\n\nValidates a message envelope, then routes it to request/response/broadcast handling based on message_type: request messages get a real OpenAI-drafted reply, response messages are actually sent over Telegram, broadcast messages are actually posted to a Slack channel. The exchange is then logged for real to Airtable.\n\n**What changed from the audited version:** the three fake \"process request/response/broadcast\" HTTP calls to `api.agent-communication.com` and the two fake \"send/log\" calls to `api.communication-service.com` / `api.communication-log.com` are gone, replaced with a real OpenAI node, a real Telegram node, a real Slack node, and a real Airtable node.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** OpenAI API key (request branch); Telegram Bot token (response branch); Slack OAuth2 (broadcast branch); Airtable Personal Access Token (final log).\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_44_AI_Agent_Communication.md for the full lesson this solves.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-communication-hub",
      "name": "Agent Communication Hub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "agent-communication",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "initialize-communication-system",
      "name": "Initialize Communication System",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "communication_session_id",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyyMMddHHmmss') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "communication_protocol",
              "value": "agent_messaging_v1"
            },
            {
              "name": "start_time",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "participating_agents",
              "value": "={{ ['agent_1', 'agent_2', 'agent_3', 'agent_4'] }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "process-communication-message",
      "name": "Process Communication Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "sender_agent",
              "value": "={{ $json.sender || 'agent_1' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "receiver_agent",
              "value": "={{ $json.receiver || 'agent_2' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message_type",
              "value": "={{ $json.message_type || 'request' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message_content",
              "value": "={{ $json.content || 'Please process this data and provide analysis.' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message_priority",
              "value": "={{ $json.priority || 'normal' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "validate-communication-protocol",
      "name": "Validate Communication Protocol",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.sender_agent }}",
              "operation": "isNotEmpty"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.receiver_agent }}",
              "operation": "isNotEmpty"
            },
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.message_content }}",
              "operation": "isNotEmpty"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "route-message",
      "name": "Route Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "string": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.message_type }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": "request"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "draft-agent-reply",
      "name": "Draft Agent Reply (OpenAI)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1440,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an AI agent responding to a request message from another agent. Treat the message content as a task to complete, and produce a concise, useful reply that the sending agent can act on."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Message from ' + $json.sender_agent + ' to ' + $json.receiver_agent + ' (priority: ' + $json.message_priority + '):\\n\\n' + $json.message_content }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "maxTokens": 400
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-response-via-telegram",
      "name": "Send Response via Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "your_chat_id",
        "text": "={{ 'Response from ' + $json.sender_agent + ' to ' + $json.receiver_agent + ':\\n\\n' + $json.message_content }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "broadcast-to-slack",
      "name": "Broadcast to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_channel_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "={{ '📢 Broadcast from ' + $json.sender_agent + ' to ' + $('Initialize Communication System').item.json.participating_agents.join(', ') + ':\\n\\n' + $json.message_content }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-message-handlers",
      "name": "Real Message Handlers Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        760
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Real, testable handlers\n\nThese three nodes replace the fake \"process request/response/broadcast\" calls to `api.agent-communication.com`. Request messages get a real OpenAI-drafted reply; response messages actually send over Telegram; broadcasts actually post to Slack.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-communication-report",
      "name": "Generate Communication Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "communication_report",
              "value": "={{ { \"communication_session_id\": $('Initialize Communication System').item.json.communication_session_id, \"communication_protocol\": $('Initialize Communication System').item.json.communication_protocol, \"start_time\": $('Initialize Communication System').item.json.start_time, \"sender_agent\": $('Process Communication Message').item.json.sender_agent, \"receiver_agent\": $('Process Communication Message').item.json.receiver_agent, \"message_type\": $('Process Communication Message').item.json.message_type, \"message_content\": $('Process Communication Message').item.json.message_content, \"message_priority\": $('Process Communication Message').item.json.message_priority, \"participating_agents\": $('Initialize Communication System').item.json.participating_agents, \"processing_time\": $now.diff($('Initialize Communication System').item.json.start_time, 'milliseconds'), \"completed_at\": $now } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "success_message",
              "value": "✅ Agent communication processing completed successfully"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "log-communication-to-airtable",
      "name": "Log Communication to Airtable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "communication_log",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "communication_session_id": "={{ $json.communication_report.communication_session_id }}",
            "sender_agent": "={{ $json.communication_report.sender_agent }}",
            "receiver_agent": "={{ $json.communication_report.receiver_agent }}",
            "message_type": "={{ $json.communication_report.message_type }}",
            "message_content": "={{ $json.communication_report.message_content }}",
            "completed_at": "={{ $json.communication_report.completed_at }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-send-log",
      "name": "Real Log Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Real, testable logging\n\nThis node replaces the fake \"Send Communication Results\" and \"Log Communication Activity\" calls to `api.communication-service.com` / `api.communication-log.com` with one real Airtable record.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "handle-communication-error",
      "name": "Handle Communication Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1200,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "communication_error",
              "value": "={{ { \"error_type\": \"communication_failed\", \"communication_session_id\": $('Initialize Communication System').item.json.communication_session_id, \"message\": \"Agent communication failed\", \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "error_response",
              "value": "={{ { \"status\": \"error\", \"communication_session_id\": $('Initialize Communication System').item.json.communication_session_id, \"message\": \"Agent communication workflow error\" } }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Agent Communication Hub": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Initialize Communication System",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Initialize Communication System": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Process Communication Message",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Process Communication Message": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validate Communication Protocol",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validate Communication Protocol": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Route Message",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Handle Communication Error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Route Message": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Draft Agent Reply (OpenAI)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Response via Telegram",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Broadcast to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Draft Agent Reply (OpenAI)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Communication Report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Send Response via Telegram": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Communication Report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Broadcast to Slack": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Communication Report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Generate Communication Report": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log Communication to Airtable",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "versionId": "2",
  "id": "day_44_solution"
}
